    <TD width="3%" nowrap align="right">&#149;</TD>
    <TD width="1%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>All of our properties are located in the Houston and San Antonio
metropolitan areas. Our operations may be adversely impacted by an
economic downturn in Houston and/or San Antonio. If we raise
substantially less than the maximum offering, we may not be able to
invest in a geographically diverse portfolio of properties.</TD>
</TR>

<TR>
    <TD colspan="5">&nbsp;</TD>
</TR>

