structure is sometimes referred to as an Umbrella Partnership Real Estate
Investment Trust, or UPREIT. We may, however, own investments directly or
through other entities. We are the sole general partner of Hartman OP. As of
March&nbsp;31, 2004, Hartman OP had 416 limited partners. The UPREIT structure
enables us to acquire real
