<P align="center" style="font-size: 10pt"><B>INVESTMENT OBJECTIVES AND CRITERIA</B>



<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The following is a discussion of our current policies with respect to
