<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt"><B>Overview</B>


 <DIV align="left"><FONT size="1">

</FONT></DIV>

<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;We own 33 commercial properties, consisting of 18 retail centers, 12
office/warehouse properties and three office buildings. All of our properties
are located in the Houston, Texas and San Antonio metropolitan areas. As of
March&nbsp;31, 2004, we had 608 total tenants. No individual lease or tenant is
material to our business. Revenues from our largest lease constituted 2.02% of
our total revenues for the three months ended March&nbsp;31, 2004. Leases for our
properties range from one year for our smaller spaces to over ten years for
larger tenants. Our leases generally include minimum monthly lease payments
and tenant reimbursements for payment of taxes, insurance and maintenance.

 <DIV align="left"><FONT size="1">

</FONT></DIV>

<DIV align="left"><FONT size="1">

</FONT></DIV>

