<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt"><B>Taxes</B>



<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;We elected to be taxed as a REIT under the Internal Revenue Code beginning
