<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt"><B>Failure to Qualify as a REIT</B>



<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If we fail to qualify as a REIT for any reason in a taxable year and
applicable relief provisions do not apply, we will be subject to tax, including
