<P align="left" style="margin-left:1%; font-size: 10pt"><B><I>Capital Gain Distributions</I></B>


<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Distributions to United States shareholders that we properly designate as
