<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt"><B>Treatment of Tax-Exempt Shareholders</B>



<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Tax-exempt entities such as employee pension benefit trusts, individual
