<P align="left" style="margin-left:1%; font-size: 10pt"><B><I>Income Effectively Connected With a United States Trade or Business</I></B>


<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;In general, non-United States shareholders will be subject to regular
