<P align="left" style="margin-left:1%; font-size: 10pt"><B><I>Sale of Our Shares by a Non-United States Shareholder</I></B>


<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A sale of our shares by a non-United States shareholder will generally not
