<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt"><B>Tax Aspects of Our Operating Partnership</B>



<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The following discussion summarizes certain federal income tax
