difference between the fair market value of the contributed property at the
time of contribution and the adjusted tax basis of such property at the time of
contribution. Under applicable Treasury Regulations, partnerships are required
to use a &#147;reasonable method&#148; for allocating items subject to Section 704(c) of
the Internal Revenue Code, and several reasonable allocation methods are
described therein.


<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Under the partnership agreement for Hartman OP, depreciation or
amortization deductions of Hartman OP generally will be allocated among the
partners in accordance with their respective interests in Hartman OP, except to
