<P align="left" style="margin-left:1%; font-size: 10pt"><B><I>1031 Exchange Program</I></B>


<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Each of the properties (Exchange Program Properties) that are the subject
