in real estate, it will have a basis in the real estate equal to its cost, and
its holding period for such real estate will begin on the day of the
acquisition. Upon subsequent sale of such interest, it will recognize gain or
loss in the same fashion it would with any other real estate investments. The
fees that a Hartman Exchange LLC pays to Hartman OP for participating in an
Exchange Program Property will be taxable as ordinary income to Hartman OP.


