<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt"><B>Fiduciary Obligations &#151; Prohibited Transactions</B>



<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Any person identified as a &#147;fiduciary&#148; with respect to a Plan incurs
duties and obligations under ERISA as discussed herein. For purposes of ERISA,
