<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt"><B>Tax Consequences of Participation</B>



<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If you elect to participate in the dividend reinvestment plan and are
