</FONT></DIV>


<P align="left" style="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Substantially all of our assets are currently held by Hartman OP and we
expect that additional investments will also be held in this manner. We are
the sole general partner of Hartman OP. Hartman OP currently has 416 limited
partners who have contributed cash and assets in exchange for units of
partnership interest in Hartman OP. As the sole general partner, we have the
exclusive power to manage and conduct the business of Hartman OP.


