<TR><TD><FONT size="1">

</FONT></TD></TR>
<TR valign="top" style="font-size: 10pt; color: #000000; background: transparent">
    <TD width="1%" nowrap align="right">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD width="1%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>On June&nbsp;30, 2003, the Company entered into a $25,000,000 loan
agreement with a bank pursuant to which the Company may, subject to
the satisfaction of certain conditions, borrow funds to acquire
additional income producing properties. The revolving loan agreement
